---
name: alembic-migrations
description: PropIQ migration standards.
---

# Authority

DATABASE_SCHEMA_DESIGN.md

# Migration Rules

Every schema change requires:

upgrade()
downgrade()

# Naming

Revision messages:

create_users_table
create_snapshot_tables
add_property_indexes

# Constraints

Always create explicit:

- PK
- FK
- UNIQUE
- CHECK

# Indexes

Add indexes for:

- foreign keys
- search fields
- frequently filtered columns

# ENUMs

Create ENUM before table creation.

Drop ENUM only when safe.

# Forbidden

No data migrations mixed with schema migrations.

No business logic.

No seed data.